Xbox prompt artwork and guest-driven world badge rotation.
Use worn dark rims, colored letters and 48-pixel texture baking to match the game.
Project the animated model plane, retaining readable faces on both sides and
existing input mappings/fallback gates. World badges remain host overlays without
shared guest depth. Release build, production mapping/projection tests and a
hidden OpenGL artwork preview pass; real combat acceptance remains manual.

